{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"旋转抛物面的截面与降维分析法","goals":["直观感知三维旋转抛物面 z = x² + y² 的形状与旋转对称特征","掌握通过固定截面高度 z = h 将三维曲面转化为平面交线方程 x² + y² = h 的推导方法","理解截面高度 h 与截线圆半径 r = √h 的动态变化关系及其降维思想"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["从直观三维曲面观察入手，建立结构直觉","结合方程代入与几何切片，推导截线圆方程","利用高度滑块联动演示半径扩大过程，深化等高线变化规律","安排互动调高练习，巩固三维转平面的降维分析能力"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":1,"min":0,"max":8,"label":"截面高度","unit":"h","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.04}}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-03-task-01","prompt":"拖动滑块将截面高度 h 调整为 4","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["向右拖动滑块以增大截面高度 h","观察截面圆半径 r 随着 √h 的变化"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"很好！截面高度 h = 4 时，截线圆半径扩展到了 2。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":4,"tolerance":0.02},"start":{"kind":"practice","variables":["number_01"],"values":{"number_01":1}}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-01","purpose":"认识三维空间中的旋转抛物面 z = x² + y² 的几何特征","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"欢迎来到三维曲面的世界！首先，我们在空间直角坐标系中引入旋转抛物面 z 等于 x 的平方加上 y 的平方。观察这个曲面，它像一个开口向上、关于 z 轴旋转对称的碗形曲面。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"scene3d","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"旋转抛物面 z = x² + y²","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 + y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 + y^2","x_range":{"min":-3,"max":3},"y_range":{"min":-3,"max":3},"samples":24}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:section","axis":"z","value":1,"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:section.value","expression":"number_01","label":{"prefix":"h = ","precision":2}}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 + y^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:1:1:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察三维抛物面 z = x² + y² 的对称性与几何形状"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:1:1:3","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-03","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"旋转抛物面特征","items":["开口向上","关于 z 轴旋转对称"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:1:1:5","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-02","purpose":"推导水平切片平面 z = h 与抛物面相交所得的截线圆方程","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们引入一个水平切片平面 z 等于 h。当这个水平平面与旋转抛物面相交时，我们将 z 等于 h 代入原曲面方程中。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:2:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = h \\implies x^2 + y^2 = h"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:2:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"x^2 + y^2 = h \\quad (r = \\sqrt{h})"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:2:1:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察水平切片平面与抛物面的相交位置"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"在 xy 平面投影来看，方程 x 方加 y 方等于 h 表示一组以原点为圆心、半径为根号 h 的同心圆。调整高度 h 即可看到圆半径随之变化。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:2:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01","kind":"geometry","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"截线圆投影 (xy平面)","axes":{"x":{"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"y"},"equal_scale":true},"points":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01:fragment:center","x":0,"y":0,"label":"(0, 0)"}],"circles":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01:fragment:circle","center":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01:fragment:center","radius":1,"label":"r = 1"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01:fragment:circle.radius","expression":"sqrt(number_01)","label":{"prefix":"r = ","precision":2},"allow_zero":true}]},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","gap":"normal","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:2:2:2","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":4,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-03","purpose":"通过动态调节高度 h，观察截线圆半径从 1 扩大到 2 的变化规律","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我从截面高度 h 等于 1 开始，再把它调节到 4。请观察空间截面和平面投影圆的变化。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-03:beat:moment-01:phase-start","op":"lesson.phase.start","transition":{"kind":"replay","values":{"number_01":1},"source_path":"/steps/2/beats/0/start"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:3:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"引导学习者调节高度滑块h"}}],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"可以看到，随着高度 h 增加到 4，截面圆的方程变为 x² + y² = 4，对应的半径 r 从 1 扩大到了 2。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:3:2:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":4,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"这种通过固定切片高度降维分析的方法，正是绘制等高线与理解三维曲面特性的核心思想。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:3:3:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:3:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-03-moment-03-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"截面高度与半径关系","items":["截面方程：x² + y² = h","截线圆半径：r = √h","当 h = 1 时，半径 r = 1","当 h = 4 时，半径 r = 2"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-04","purpose":"总结三维转平面的降维分析法，并完成切片高度控制的互动练习","beats":[{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"总结一下，面对复杂的曲面时，我们可以通过固定某个坐标轴的数值，比如令 z 等于 h，将三维问题降维成二维平面的曲线问题。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:4:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"降维分析法总结","items":["固定三维变量: 令 z = h","得到二维方程: x² + y² = h","截线形状: 圆心在原点、半径 r = √h 的圆"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-03-moment-03-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:4:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"总结降维分析法的核心步骤与特点"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:step:section-04:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"讲解结束后，你可以在课后练习中把截面高度从 1 调节到 4，检验截线圆的半径是否变为 2。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:action:4:2:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","surface-paraboloid-level-sets-0.1.1:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"compare"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
